id:                              DRAFT-udt-4.11-upstream-test-result-preservation-and-bind-shadow
trigger_tool:                   make|conan|test
phase:                          testing|building
error_signature:                HMBS_UPSTREAM_TEST_RESULT=\\{[^}]*\"status\":\"passed\"[^}]*\"discovered\":0|rule4：必须声明合法的 upstream_test_total|invalid operands to binary expression\('__bind|int' and 'int'\)
severity:                         2
category:                       libc++, posix, testing, build-system, cmake, portability, ohos
match_keywords:                 readonly_tmp,hmbs_upstream_test_result,hmbs_test_package_result,hmbs_repair_method,hmbs_platform_capabilities,hmbs_cmake,std_bind_shadow,bind_shadow,libcxx,cache_reuse,upstream_test_missing,manifest_upstream_test_total
title:                          上游无 formal make check 时将 demo 改造为新增回归测试，保留独立上游盘点口径
root_cause:                   autotools 系部分库的源码归档没有 formal 测试目标，配方如实标记 upstream_tests_exist:false 输出 no_tests/0，但真机证据门禁拒绝零证据放行
affected_scope:               上游无 formal make check/ctest 但 demo/ 目录含可独立编译示例的 autotools 类 C/C++ 库
verification_cmd:           真机日志保留真实上游结果和 HMBS_TEST_PACKAGE_RESULT 新增用例结果；独立盘点总数不得被 demo 数替代
rec_priority:                 1
rec_approach:               add-demo-derived-adaptation-tests
rec_description:            独立盘点原始上游测试；将 demo 改造的快速验证仅计为新增测试，每轮真实执行后生成结果，不得替代或增加上游测试数
rec_command:                test_package/: 新增 demo_regression_*.cpp；MANIFEST.yml: upstream_test_total 按独立盘点填写，demo 改造测试单列为新增测试
rec_auto_fix:               false
rec_impl:                   conan-recipe-plus-test-package
fallback_priority:          2
fallback_approach:          api-equivalent-substitute-test
fallback_description:     若 demo 依赖过多无法独立编译，保留失败审计记录，编写等价 API 断言式测试替代
fallback_auto_fix:        false
forbid_1_pattern:           HMBS_UPSTREAM_TEST_RESULT=\\{[^}]*\"discovered\":0[^}]*\"status\":\"passed\"
forbid_1_reason:            禁止零证据放行标记；门禁要求上游存在测试时必须真实发现并执行
forbid_1_consequence:     真机预检 evidence incomplete，任务退回修复循环
similar_to:                   DRAFT-libb64-2.0.0-upstream-make-test-missing-library-target
